  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "• Freehold Family Home in a Sought-After Coastal Setting\r\n• Remodelled with Weatherboard & Cedar Cladding\r\n• Elevated Sea Views across Mairangi Bay & the Hauraki Gulf\r\n• Multiple Living Areas, Expansive Decking & Exceptional Indoor-Outdoor Flow\r\n• 4 Bedrooms, 2 Bathrooms + Flexibility for a Fifth\r\n• Separate Laundry for Added Practicality \r\n• Double Garage + Generous Off-Street Parking, with Room for the Boat\r\n• Zoned for Rangitoto College, Murrays Bay Intermediate & Murrays Bay School\r\n\r\n\r\nAfter 22 much-loved years, this beautifully remodelled four-bedroom family home in the highly sought-after Rangitoto College zone is ready for its next chapter, offering elevated views, exceptional flexibility and an enviable coastal lifestyle. \r\n\r\nRecently upgraded by QPC Build Group, the home features a flexible layout that can easily be configured to accommodate five bedrooms, with plenty of room for all the family, guests or those needing generous work-from-home space.\r\n\r\nSunny living spaces connect effortlessly with expansive decking and private courtyards, while low-maintenance gardens make the outdoor areas easy to enjoy and care for.\r\n\r\nDouble glazing, excellent storage, a double garage and generous off-street parking, including room for the boat and everyday practicality; while the timeless combination of weatherboard and cedar complements the home's coastal setting.\r\n\r\nBeaches, scenic walks, cafés, restaurants, shopping and transport are all close by, with zoning for Murrays Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Rangitoto College completing an exceptional Mairangi Bay offering.\r\n\r\nWith space, sunshine, sea views, parking and plenty of flexibility, there's little need to compromise on the wish- list here.\r\n\r\nA truly special home, now available for you to discover.",
